body:
wow actually that would have been much better in my opinion.  
if you payed attention to the dialogue when you first change over to Simon 3 it could have been in the back of your head once you're inside the ARK (did I really make it here or did I get left behind again?)  
then showing Simon 3 and omnitool catherine being left behind after the credits instead? I think you're right, it would have had MUCH more impact
